  "verificationScope": "# SAME native short-exact roof realized by an ACTUAL injective cocycle\n\nLET A be an abelian category with native Ext/derived structures,S an\nACTUAL short exact sequence0->A->B->C->0,N a coefficient object,\nI ANY actual injective resolution of N,and a:A->N. THEN CONSTRUCT\nan actual0cochain b from B[0] to I and actual1cocycle c from C[0] to I,\nwith S.f^*b=ofHom(single(a)>>I.iota) and d(b)=S.g^*c. PROVE\n  a_*Lambda_S^roof = -[c]_I,\n  Ext.delta_S^0(mk0(a)) = [c]_I.\n[c]_I is EXACTLY I.extEquivCohomologyClass.symm(mk c). There is NO\nlift datum,desired class equality,desired compatibility square,arbitrary\nreplacement class,or global-projectivity assumption in this final theorem.\n\nThe generic lift constructor only requires target degree0 injective.\nNative injective resolutions DERIVE that instance. Reuse actual\nInjective.factorThru and actual source cokernel descent;construct the\ncocycle and both cochain lifting equations. The native Hom-complex cone\ncalculation PROVES [fst*a]=[c*alpha];cohomology equality gives SAME derived\nmaps via actual homotopy. Native triangle third map is MINUS fst;retain\nthis negative sign through native shift comparison and inverse quasiisos.\nInt.cast_ofNat_Int normalizes the native Ext degree before final equality.\nThis is an ACTUAL degree-one class computation,not just source naturality.\n\n8ordinary proved theorems,6individually compiled roots,8closed project\nmodules. All8full imported types,semantic proof roles and standard axiom\nclosures read. Only propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound. Both nonroot\nsources byte-match the immediately preceding fully PUBLIC source-naturality\narchive. All referenced native source bytes match the pinned mathlib Git\ncommit after LF normalization. No frozen source is changed during release.\nNo whole-project replay or new remote whole-project Lean CI is claimed.\n\nOPEN:identify the SAME arbitrary-length ORIGINAL Koszul ordered functional,\nquotient augmentation and epsilon;iterate compatible source sequences and\nkeep full degree signs;actual a|S formula;concrete original geometric\ncomparison;global-to-local isomorphism;properduality/canonicaltheta,\nambienttwist/independentframes/uniformfixedm. This native cone result does\nNOT itself identify even an original geometric length-one complex with\nthe cone and SAME quotient augmentation. That identification is separate.\nOriginal4.1/4.2/main OPEN;preserve1<=r<n,d>=2,ONE NONEMPTY parameteropen\nBEFORE ALLintegerk and parameterc distinct from finalQ. Unverified4.1\ninterface is NOTaxiom. GLOBAL Ext is distinct from INTERNAL SHEAF Ext\nand affine MODULE Ext. Local freeness is NOT global projectivity.\n\nKeep onecompiler,8GiBWindowsJob,2threads,CPU25%,BelowNormal,20min,\nallRAM/commit/disk thresholds;preserve ALL holds and EXCLUDE held sources.\nNo extraagents,no increased memory or heartbeat limits,no OSsettingchanges.\nAlltaskfilesD. Wholelocalcheckpoint180;181interrupted/not accepted.\nLean4.35.0-rc3,pinnedmathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
